## Setup
```bash
cp .env.example .env        # then fill in real values (never commit .env)
docker compose up --build   # starts api (8080) and ledger (Postgres)
curl http://localhost:8080/health      # {"status":"ok"}
curl http://localhost:8080/api/runs    # includes sbx-seeddemo1
```
Backend tests: `cd backend && pip install -r requirements.txt && pytest tests`
Report validation (fails until real reports exist): `pip install pytest && pytest tests/test_reports.py`

## Architecture
Trusted control plane (FastAPI + Postgres via Docker Compose) -> Celesto SDK -> untrusted Celesto sandboxes. Diagram TODO.

## Technology stack
FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL, Docker Compose, Celesto SDK (Cloud), React/Vite/Tailwind/Recharts (planned).

